  "_commentGenderNonEnglish": "Men's-wear words in every language the catalogue now carries (fr/nl/de/it/da/tr/id). Added 2026-08-10 after 'Box ramadan homme - bleu' published: exclusions run on the ORIGINAL title, translation runs later at publish time, so an English-only gender filter cannot see foreign menswear at all. Each is \\b-anchored (§10.5) and was measured against the full raw catalogue before adding — fr matched 1 (the leak), the other six matched 0."
